00:38:32.520 --> 00:38:40.450
<v Ira Glass>You know, I gave Torey a tape of a recent show  and I told him he had to listen to the show. And he keeps making these excuses. He swears there is something wrong with the recording.

00:38:40.450 --> 00:38:44.750
<v Eric Hayot>And then on the tape, there'd be this-- "Tsung, xie, xie, tsung, xie, xie, tsung."

00:38:44.750 --> 00:39:10.880
